	"system": {
		"description": "<p>At 17th level, your reputation is such that others will flock to your banner in times of need. By spending 8 hours recruiting, you are able to gather four @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-monsters.Actor.h7t7p23al4a9iehw]{Squads of Soldiers} and a @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-monsters.Actor.05xw3umyhise1ptt]{Champion Warrior} to lead them. These allies will help you in a single major engagement, such as a battle or taking a clear objective such as attacking a castle or enemy force. However after the encounter, which can last up to one hour, they will disperse.</p>",
